      {
        "id": "91fec3b0-b2e4-470e-82cf-051ae2054a83",
        "quote": "The absolute pinnacle of open worlds ever crafted in the medium. Everything from the castles, to the huge empty landscapes, to the immaculate combat, to the dark dungeons and caves, to the cinematic and beautiful boss fights, to the story, intertwines and comes together to make an experience on one of the highest levels we’ve ever seen in fiction",
